## Model card

- **Name:** Mai Experimental Test
- **Short description:** anonymous free experimental slot on OpenCode Zen that has quietly accumulated major usage (#17 all-time-window rank); no company has claimed it and no evidence ties it to any tracked model. Origin unknown — not established as a variant of any other entry.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen (`opencode/mai-experimental-test`); usage telemetry at `opencode.ai/data/unknown/mai-experimental-test` (publisher namespace "unknown").
- **Release / knowledge:** OpenCode usage data runs 2026-08-08 → 2026-10-02; no release date published (page lists Release: Unknown); knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `opencode/mai-experimental-test` (OpenCode Zen); no public per-token API ID published on OpenRouter/models.dev tracked sources.
- **Context window:** Unknown — OpenCode's data page reports Context: Unknown; no provider spec sheet found. (The folder's scaffolded `meta.json` 128K figure is a stub, not verified evidence.)
- **Modalities:** Unknown — OpenCode lists Inputs: Unknown; no modality documentation found.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-02):** no published per-token price; served free — OpenCode data shows $0.00 total observed spend over 286B tokens. Free-tier caveat: an unclaimed model has no accountable data-handling policy.
- **Architecture:** not disclosed. No parameters, MoE layout, or license published.

