### Non-benchmark evidence (why the model is tracked at all)

- OpenCode usage rank **#17** last week; **286B tokens** over 2 months (+100% growth), **56K unique users**, **586,394** completed sessions, 71% cache ratio, 487K avg tokens/session (opencode.ai/data/unknown/mai-experimental-test, 2026-10-02).
- Sharp demand spike at the end of the window: daily tokens 3.4–4.8B (Sep 22–29) → 18B (Sep 30) → 77B (Oct 1) → 159B (Oct 2); unique users 6.3K → 16K (same page).
- Usage peers listed beside deepseek-v4-pro, mimo-v2.6-pro, nemotron-3.5-lightning, qwen3.8-flash (same page) — placement by token volume only, not evidence of shared origin.

